      "version": "1",
      "title": "North Replacement Access Card Policy",
      "text": "Meridian North replacement access card requests must be submitted through the North access portal. Lost cards must be reported to the North security desk immediately. Replacement requests have a target acknowledgement time of three business days. This policy does not specify a card delivery deadline or a replacement fee."
    }
